   2. Updated editor_element.rs to measure actual glyph advance by shaping reference character "M"
   3. Refined lib.rs to use .to_owned() instead of .clone() for Arc<String> extraction
   4. Added SharedString, TextRun, and font imports to window.rs
   5. Implemented accurate glyph_advance_px measurement in window.rs render method (line ~1109)
   6. Updated comment at line 1786 to reference measured value
   7. Removed duplicate glyph_advance_px calculation at line ~1817 to use outer scope value

   The final edit removed the local variable shadowing that was reverting to the approximation formula, ensuring the accurate measurement is used throughout the render method for both pane column geometry and cursor-anchored popup placement.

