   - ✅ Measurements are reused efficiently (calculated once per frame)
   - ✅ Both approximation sites in window.rs have been replaced with accurate measurements

   Users can now configure fonts via `:set ui.font_family=Monaco` and `:set ui.font_size=16`, and the accurate glyph width measurements should fix the reported cursor positioning issues.

